Every Imlek, I would bake trays of nastar with my mother and sister. Its design varies depending on the Chinese zodiac of that year.
It's a pretty new tradition for our family, but nastar has been a popular cookie for Imlek and Lebaran for centuries.
It's not that time of year right now, so we can decorate however we like!
